plaintext
  
openeuler/qemu
cca_guest_realize
    -> kvm_arm_create_vm(KVM_VM_TYPE_CCA)
        -> ioctl(KVM_CREATE_VM)
OLK6.6 virt/kvm/kvm_main.c:kvm_create_vm
    -> arch/arm64/kvm/init.c:kvm_arch_vm_create
        -> cca.c:kvm_cca_vm_init
            -> realm.c:kvm_cca_create_realm
                -> rmi_smc.c:rmi_invoke(RMI_REALM_CREATE)
                    -> arm_smccc_smc 触发SMC陷入EL3
