    -> 跳转TF-RMM arch/arm64/arm64_smc.c:handle_smc
        -> core/rmi.c:rmi_dispatch
            -> core/realm.c:realm_create

QEMU KVM_CREATE_VCPU
    -> OLK rec.c:kvm_cca_create_rec
        -> rmi_invoke(RMI_REC_CREATE)
            -> RMM rec.c:rec_create
                -> arch_rec_init 初始化影子寄存器

